{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/50f6e44d6259635b2e490888ffa7faf0.avif?t=1772228682\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras_big/50f6e44d6259635b2e490888ffa7faf0.avif?t=1772228682 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SLAUGHTER VOID</i></strong>\u00a0is a stylish, vicious, and uncompromising experience with an emphasis on speed. In this high-speed &quot;dungeon runner&quot;, carve your way through enemy after enemy on a path to vengeance. Splatter your way through demons and cultists in a variety of worlds in this homage to 80's arcade action and fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die fast. Kill faster.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast paced, brutal action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in<i><strong> SLAUGHTER VOID</strong></i> is quick and merciless. A single hit will kill you, but the same goes for (most of) your enemies- agility and aggression are e<i>ssential.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/e67488a300b915ba4e7405284093b4f2.poster.avif?t=1772228682\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/e67488a300b915ba4e7405284093b4f2.webm?t=1772228682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/e67488a300b915ba4e7405284093b4f2.mp4?t=1772228682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be your own harbinger of destruction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through a deluge of hand-crafted levels, carve your own bloody path with unique combinations of weapons and relics to achieve maximum slaughter.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/95b2f91ecf131d04bc19ab906c561cff.poster.avif?t=1772228682\" width=1170 height=620 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/95b2f91ecf131d04bc19ab906c561cff.webm?t=1772228682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/95b2f91ecf131d04bc19ab906c561cff.mp4?t=1772228682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Dismemberment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick death is not enough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you kill, the more havoc you wreak upon your foes, severing and splattering them into multiple pieces. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you slaughter, the more you reap, harvesting valuable loot from their corpses to spend on upgrades, items, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/a0663d946c5fc3421118354f6e05b255.poster.avif?t=1772228682\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/a0663d946c5fc3421118354f6e05b255.webm?t=1772228682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/a0663d946c5fc3421118354f6e05b255.mp4?t=1772228682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>To the Victor the Spoils</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete to be the fastest on the leader boards as you decimate enemies from this gore-soaked void to the next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36 Handcrafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich story inspired by retro fantasy paperback novels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapons to customize your play style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of viscous enemies\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hub of unique characters to aid in your quest</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3333980?t=1772228682","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3333980?t=1772228682","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/2504a5bcb3d899813522294f0763fc9657525ab7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772228682","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/2504a5bcb3d899813522294f0763fc9657525ab7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772228682","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Excessive pixel art fantasy blood and gore"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3730700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/50f6e44d6259635b2e490888ffa7faf0.avif?t=1772228682\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras_big/50f6e44d6259635b2e490888ffa7faf0.avif?t=1772228682 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p cla