 customize your play style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of viscous enemies\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hub of unique characters to aid in your quest</p></li></ul>","developers":["Dread Night"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/cfbf50c1ccb4d780bfb131c31fd2d5062ccd0138/header.jpg?t=1772228682","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3333980/501738989/255c5bfe582a4611a1c3c3f5204d4ad74521fb1b/1770916989/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770918853","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3333980/501738989/255c5bfe582a4611a1c3c3f5204d4ad74521fb1b/1770916989/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770918853","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3333980/501738989/255c5bfe582a4611a1c3c3f5204d4ad74521fb1b/1770916989/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770918853","id":257072812,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257072812/d60c4448bb4bb5e0932c38bc7b23feade4fa1315/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770918853"}],"name":"Slaughter Void","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> @ 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 2000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> For more brutal beatdowns</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Dread Night"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia Extrema","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Dr